    {
      "subId": "7100606",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710060601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710060601": {
            "id": "710060601",
            "speakerId": 2409,
            "speakerName": "Vermeer",
            "text": "Have you found my painting tools?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060602"
            ]
          },
          "710060602": {
            "id": "710060602",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yup.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060603"
            ]
          },
          "710060603": {
            "id": "710060603",
            "speakerId": 2409,
            "speakerName": "Vermeer",
            "text": "Just as I thought, I left them in the place I was taking references from. I tend to put the things I've used on the ground while I paint out of habit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060604"
            ]
          },
          "710060604": {
            "id": "710060604",
            "speakerId": 2409,
            "speakerName": "Vermeer",
            "text": "When I'm in too much of a rush, I tend to leave a lot of things behind. Thank you so much. If not for you, I'd have to go back into the city to buy more.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060605"
            ]
          },
          "710060605": {
            "id": "710060605",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You're going to continue painting here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060606"
            ]
          },
          "710060606": {
            "id": "710060606",
            "speakerId": 2409,
            "speakerName": "Vermeer",
            "text": "Don't even mention it. I'd heard people say that these two statues have eyes that could light up, and that you could see that from afar.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060607"
            ]
          },
          "710060607": {
            "id": "710060607",
            "speakerId": 2409,
            "speakerName": "Vermeer",
            "text": "Giant statues with blazing eyes, standing guard next to a mountain... It would surely have made an excellent painting.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060608"
            ]
          },
          "710060608": {
            "id": "710060608",
            "speakerId": 2409,
            "speakerName": "Vermeer",
            "text": "But when I came here, the statues were here, but there were no shining eyes to be found.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060609"
            ]
          },
          "710060609": {
            "id": "710060609",
            "speakerId": 2409,
            "speakerName": "Vermeer",
            "text": "I thought that I might have missed some special timing, or that my angle was off, which is why I've been walking around.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060610"
            ]
          },
          "710060610": {
            "id": "710060610",
            "speakerId": 2409,
            "speakerName": "Vermeer",
            "text": "But it seems that no matter where I stand, the scenery doesn't change...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060611"
            ]
          },
          "710060611": {
            "id": "710060611",
            "speakerId": 2409,
            "speakerName": "Vermeer",
            "text": "The only thing I've gotten out of the whole venture is this — I found it in the pond down there...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060612"
            ]
          },
          "710060612": {
            "id": "710060612",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hmm, I found one too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060613"
            ]
          },
          "710060613": {
            "id": "710060613",
            "speakerId": 2409,
            "speakerName": "Vermeer",
            "text": "Did you? Let me have a look. Why, I never — they're identical.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060614"
            ]
          },
          "710060614": {
            "id": "710060614",
            "speakerId": 2409,
            "speakerName": "Vermeer",
            "text": "Strange. There are even words carved into the back. Now, what do they say...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060615"
            ]
          },
          "710060615": {
            "id": "710060615",
            "speakerId": 2409,
            "speakerName": "Vermeer",
            "text": "\"The stone sentinels hold the gate as such, against those who add not a finishing touch...\" What does this mean?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060616"
            ]
          },
          "710060616": {
            "id": "710060616",
            "speakerId": 2409,
            "speakerName": "Vermeer",
            "text": "Well, this rock's of little use to me, anyway, so why don't you have it? Consider it thanks for helping me find my tools.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060617"
            ]
          },
          "710060617": {
            "id": "710060617",
            "speakerId": 2409,
            "speakerName": "Vermeer",
            "text": "Actually, I have a thought. It's just a wild guess, but don't you think these two rocks look a bit like eyes?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060618"
            ]
          },
          "710060618": {
            "id": "710060618",
            "speakerId": 2409,
            "speakerName": "Vermeer",
            "text": "If they really are eyes, do you think that the \"finishing touch\" has something to do with these two stones.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710060619"
            ]
          },
          "710060619": {
            "id": "710060619",
            "speakerId": 2409,
            "speakerName": "Vermeer",
            "text": "Well, it's just a guess, so don't think too hard about it. I'm going to look for other views, now — thanks for finding my tools for me!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}